				<div id="email_details">
					<p>
						I use ProtonMail, and privacy for ProtonMail users is already taken care of,
						but if you prefer a different email provided, you can use my PGP key to improve the privacy of our correspondence.
						It's not a strict requirement, but it will be greatly appreciated.
